    {
      "id": "noteIntro",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": -40,
      "y": -217,
      "init": {
        "label": "Remodel (Gantt)",
        "body": "# When will it be done, and what can't slip?\nThe tasks are a **Cube Input**: each record names the task, its **Duration** in working days, and its **Predecessors** as a list. Open the chip to edit a row, a list, or a nested table in place. A **Schedule** node runs the critical-path method over them.\n\nIt appends **Start · Finish · Float · Critical** to the rows. Float is how many days a task can slip without moving the finish; the tasks with none are the critical path. **Project finish** comes out as its own value, and **Gantt** is Mermaid source the Mermaid node draws. A **Holidays** node feeds the days to skip.\n\nTry it: make Paint take 5 days instead of 2 and watch it join the critical path.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 270
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tasks",
      "type": "CubeInputNode",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 493,
      "init": {
        "label": "Tasks",
        "cubeText": "[\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Demolition\",\n    \"days\": 2,\n    \"after\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Plumbing rough-in\",\n    \"days\": 3,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Demolition\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Electrical rough-in\",\n    \"days\": 2,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Demolition\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Drywall\",\n    \"days\": 2,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Plumbing rough-in\",\n      \"Electrical rough-in\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Paint\",\n    \"days\": 2,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Drywall\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Cabinets\",\n    \"days\": 4,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Drywall\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Countertops\",\n    \"days\": 5,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Cabinets\",\n      \"Paint\"\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"task\": \"Final inspection\",\n    \"days\": 0,\n    \"after\": [\n      \"Countertops\"\n    ]\n  }\n]"
